{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026dsTm3nRNRV1794796797.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>TVB台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》現正熱播，陳自瑤（Yoyo）在劇中飾演關鍵角色「關子盈」。早前劇情講述她接連慘遭好姊妹出賣與陷害，連場虐心重頭戲播出後，其精湛演技引發觀眾極大迴響。近日忙於為劇集造勢的她，於社交網大晒一輯出席宣傳活動的靚相，並留言問道：「近馬不停蹄為新劇宣傳 大家喜歡關子盈嗎？🌹」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"56cf7194-1fd7-48f9-b2a9-a4a06c000ac2.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026MdJd04l8r01794796797.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>從公開的照片中所見，陳自瑤一改劇中的悲情形象，換上一身純白露肩緞面超高衩拖尾晚裝驚艷亮相，而禮服腰間更特別點綴了一朵立體白玫瑰，完美呼應劇名《玫瑰戰爭》。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"eacc3deb-6bbf-4a39-a7be-fec055860795.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026XCfLv8sLXy1794796796.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>配合一頭柔順黑長直髮及明艷紅唇，她在戲院紅色觀眾席階梯及紅色舞台邊優雅擺出甫士，大方展現白滑香肩與一雙修長美腿，盡顯高貴女神氣場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T03:51:52.377405+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":289,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T02:37:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T08:24:10.777615+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T03:45:11.742539+00:00","content_hash":"98a4d23208fecd38db473d8d370b25d2389c5941a0d0ad55478ef48954d17bcd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T03:51:52.377405+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}